# 📖 TOEIC Grammar - Day 02

## Topic
# Present Perfect + already / yet / just / ever / never

---

## Rule

### already = 이미 (긍정문)

Structure

have/has + already + p.p

Examples

- I have already finished my homework.
- She has already left the office.

---

### yet = 아직 / 이미? (부정문, 의문문)

Examples

- I haven't finished my homework yet.
- Have you finished your homework yet?

---

### just = 방금

Examples

- I have just arrived.
- She has just called me.

---

### ever = 한 번이라도

Examples

- Have you ever been to Japan?
- Have you ever tried Korean food?

---

### never = 한 번도 ~없다

Examples

- I have never visited Europe.
- He has never seen snow.

---

## Remember

| Word | Usage |
|------|-------|
| already | 긍정문 |
| yet | 의문문 / 부정문 |
| just | 방금 |
| ever | 경험 질문 |
| never | 경험 부정 |

---

## Exam Tip

already → 긍정문

yet → 의문문 / 부정문

ever → Have you ever...?

never → 한 번도 없다
